            nursing: ['CIWA 19 then 27; visual hallucinations; disoriented to time; HR 130, BP 182/106, T 101.4 F.', 'IV lorazepam given with continuous SpO2; RASS documented; sitter at bedside.', 'IV access protected; seizure and aspiration precautions; NPO except meds.'],
